            <title>[IGNITE-18282] Illegal use of dynamic parameter exception in SQL functions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18282</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Query&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

